      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Um... Yes? Can I help you with something?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006D002E002E002E0020005900650073003F002000430061006E00200049002000680065006C007000200079006F00750020007700690074006800200073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067003F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You see, your Tinkatuff...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007300650065002C00200079006F00750072002000540069006E006B00610074007500660066002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Your neighbor’s Scizor...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500720020006E00650069006700680062006F0072201900730020005300630069007A006F0072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! Is this about the Scizor that lives next door?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002100200049007300200074006800690073002000610062006F0075007400200074006800650020005300630069007A006F0072002000740068006100740020006C00690076006500730020006E00650078007400200064006F006F0072003F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know, I know. I keep catching my Tinkatuff\nstaring at it.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006B006E006F0077002C002000490020006B006E006F0077002E002000490020006B0065006500700020006300610074006300680069006E00670020006D0079002000540069006E006B00610074007500660066000A00730074006100720069006E0067002000610074002000690074002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think Tinkatuff’s just a bit afraid and is feeling\non edge. Scizor DOES have an intimidating look.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I suppose being stared at all the time is also\nintimidating in its own way, isn’t it?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m so sorry you got dragged into this. Could you\nlet my neighbor know there’s no harm intended?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tink...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069006E006B002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So? Why does that Tinkatuff keep staring at my\nScizor?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F003F002000570068007900200064006F0065007300200074006800610074002000540069006E006B006100740075006600660020006B006500650070002000730074006100720069006E00670020006100740020006D0079000A005300630069007A006F0072003F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scizor looks intimidating",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300630069007A006F00720020006C006F006F006B007300200069006E00740069006D00690064006100740069006E00670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s scared of your Scizor",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200073006300610072006500640020006F006600200079006F007500720020005300630069007A006F00720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What?! So it’s staring at my poor, frightened\nPokémon because it thinks Scizor looks scary?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What?! So that Tinkatuff is scared of my Scizor—\nand Scizor is simultaneously scared of Tinkatuff?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I mean...it’s not like Scizor can change its face.\nThat’s just the way it looks.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Even if it IS scared, doesn’t it realize how scary it\nis to be constantly stared at like that?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What has happened to my peaceful home life?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEverything was fine until that weird Pokémon\nmoved in next door!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come to think of it, don’t people say Tinkatuff\nlikes to attack other Pokémon to steal their metal?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhat if...what if it’s got its eyes on my Pokémon\nbecause of Scizor’s Steel type?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 190
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zorrr?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A006F007200720072003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t worry, Scizor! I’ll protect you with my life if I\nhave to!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E2019007400200077006F007200720079002C0020005300630069007A006F00720021002000492019006C006C002000700072006F007400650063007400200079006F0075002000770069007400680020006D00790020006C00690066006500200069006600200049000A006800610076006500200074006F002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My poor Scizor won’t be able to rest easy like this!\nWho knows if we can trust that lady’s Pokémon?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Look—I’m sure she’s got her own things going\non, having just moved here and all, but please...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncan you get her to understand our feelings too?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sci...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300630069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Back again from that neighbor of mine?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200610063006B00200061006700610069006E002000660072006F006D002000740068006100740020006E00650069006700680062006F00720020006F00660020006D0069006E0065003F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "His Pokémon’s afraid of yours",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480069007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E2019007300200061006600720061006900640020006F006600200079006F0075007200730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Your Tinkatuff is scaring them",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750072002000540069006E006B00610074007500660066002000690073002000730063006100720069006E00670020007400680065006D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "HIS Pokémon is afraid? That’s what he told you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480049005300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006900730020006100660072006100690064003F00200054006800610074201900730020007700680061007400200068006500200074006F006C006400200079006F0075003F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Pokémon is scaring them? But it’s such a\nsweetheart! They don’t even know Tinkatuff!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My sweet Tinkatuff would never attack another\nPokémon just to get more metal.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, almost never.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C00200061006C006D006F007300740020006E0065007600650072002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tuff!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750066006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’re the ones who just moved in here. WE’RE\nthe ones who are uneasy. And THEY’RE saying<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwe’re scary?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then I want proof that my neighbor’s Scizor isn’t\nglaring at Tinkatuff to intimidate it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tink...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069006E006B002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So? What’d she say now?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F003F0020005700680061007420190064002000730068006500200073006100790020006E006F0077003F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "She doesn’t quite trust your Scizor",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530068006500200064006F00650073006E2019007400200071007500690074006500200074007200750073007400200079006F007500720020005300630069007A006F00720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "She says you can trust Tinkatuff",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006800650020007300610079007300200079006F0075002000630061006E002000740072007500730074002000540069006E006B006100740075006600660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Who could doubt my sweet and timid Scizor?!\nThere’s not a threatening bone in its body!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "She SAYS that, but talk is cheap. All’s well and\ngood till Tinkatuff gives Scizor an iron deficiency!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Look, I get that it’s gotta be scary moving to a\nnew region and all, but...but we live here too!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 7088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, I don’t see any choice but to prove to her\nthat my Scizor is perfectly innocent and not scary!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 7292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How will you do that?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F0077002000770069006C006C00200079006F007500200064006F00200074006800610074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You think you can?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007400680069006E006B00200079006F0075002000630061006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ll just have to get Scizor and Tinkatuff to know\neach other face-to-face!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 7588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Though I’d feel a lot better if you were there too...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 7752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006F00750067006800200049201900640020006600650065006C002000610020006C006F0074002000620065007400740065007200200069006600200079006F00750020007700650072006500200074006800650072006500200074006F006F002E002E002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Go ask my neighbor if she’s game. If she is, we\ncan both bring our Pokémon to meet!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 7868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zorrr...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 8044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A006F007200720072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 8064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He wants Tinkatuff and Scizor to get to know\neach other?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 8076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065002000770061006E00740073002000540069006E006B0061007400750066006600200061006E00640020005300630069007A006F007200200074006F002000670065007400200074006F0020006B006E006F0077000A00650061006300680020006F0074006800650072003F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All right!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 8200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C002000720069006700680074002100100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tinkatuff and I have also been stressed about this\nwhole situation.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 8232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069006E006B0061007400750066006600200061006E0064002000490020006800610076006500200061006C0073006F0020006200650065006E002000730074007200650073007300650064002000610062006F0075007400200074006800690073000A00770068006F006C006500200073006900740075006100740069006F006E002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s meet up and prove once and for all that my\nPokémon is no threat to that Scizor!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 8376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We can do that—right, Tinkatuff?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 8556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065002000630061006E00200064006F00200074006800610074201400720069006700680074002C002000540069006E006B00610074007500660066003F00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tink!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 8632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069006E006B00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿E",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 8644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00450000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK. Now that we’re all here, let’s introduce our\nPokémon to each other.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 8656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And if anything starts to look dicey, we call them\nboth into their Poké Balls.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 8808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This way, Scizor!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 8976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006900730020007700610079002C0020005300630069007A006F0072002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Over here, Tinkatuff!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 73,
      "offsetInSection": 9020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00760065007200200068006500720065002C002000540069006E006B00610074007500660066002100100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Your Tinkatuff seems rather...bashful.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 74,
      "offsetInSection": 9072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750072002000540069006E006B006100740075006600660020007300650065006D00730020007200610074006800650072002E002E002E006200610073006800660075006C002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scizor...does seem rather scared.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 75,
      "offsetInSection": 9160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300630069007A006F0072002E002E002E0064006F006500730020007300650065006D00200072006100740068006500720020007300630061007200650064002E00100002011401AD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tink! ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 76,
      "offsetInSection": 9236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069006E006B00210020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zorrr...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 77,
      "offsetInSection": 9252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A006F007200720072002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tinkatuff doesn’t show any sign of attacking.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 9272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069006E006B0061007400750066006600200064006F00650073006E20190074002000730068006F007700200061006E00790020007300690067006E0020006F0066002000610074007400610063006B0069006E0067002E00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And Scizor only looks a bit scary, but it really isn’t\nscary at all.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI guess they assumed the worst of each other,\ndidn’t they?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 9372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zor!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 80,
      "offsetInSection": 9644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A006F007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tuff!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 81,
      "offsetInSection": 9656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750066006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our Pokémon are looking friendlier already!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 82,
      "offsetInSection": 9668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0075007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200061007200650020006C006F006F006B0069006E006700200066007200690065006E0064006C00690065007200200061006C00720065006100640079002100100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes. And I hope we can be friends as well!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’m still adjusting to Lumiose. It would be nice to\nhave someone I can ask for help.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 83,
      "offsetInSection": 9764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It was nice of this Trainer to go out of h<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂiser way to\nhelp some strangers like us.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 84,
      "offsetInSection": 10036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! Tinkatuff, no! Don’t go ripping the metal off\nthose chimney pipes!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 85,
      "offsetInSection": 10220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Th-this’ll be fine...right?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 86,
      "offsetInSection": 10372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068002D00740068006900732019006C006C002000620065002000660069006E0065002E002E002E00720069006700680074003F00100002011401AC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sci...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 10436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300630069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tuff!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 10452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750066006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿Y",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 10464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve been talking more with Herrera, and our\nPokémon have both been getting along well.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo far.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƬ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 10476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sciii...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 10684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530063006900690069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Acier has been teaching me so much about life in\nLumiose! He’s going to be such a great help.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd my little Tinkatuff can hardly keep its mitts\noff of its new pal Scizor!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƭ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 92,
      "offsetInSection": 10704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 178
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tinka!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 93,
      "offsetInSection": 11060,
